Rhykaris Master Map — licensing overview
========================================

This repository holds three kinds of material, licensed separately:

1. SOURCE CODE — MIT License (full text below)
     app/       the map viewer (HTML, JavaScript, CSS)
     scripts/   build tooling
     src/       the Python terrain and data pipeline
                (except src/places_data.py and src/build_data.py — see 2)

2. WORLD CONTENT — Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-NoDerivatives 4.0
   International (CC BY-NC-ND 4.0) — see LICENSE-CONTENT.md
     data/  assets/  docs/  README.md
     src/places_data.py  src/build_data.py   (the world's datasets, written as code)
     the map data, images and lore text embedded in the built index.html

3. THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS keep their own licenses — see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
     vendor/leaflet/, plus the fonts that index.html loads from Google Fonts

